{
    "_comment": [
        "Overlay of esp-brookesia's launcher screen for the AMOLED 1.8 V2.",
        "",
        "Single delta from upstream: grid_stage no longer declares itself",
        "scrollable unconditionally. It starts NON-scrollable and",
        "shell_app_launcher.cpp binds `grid_scrollable` true only when the tiles",
        "genuinely overflow the 388dp viewport (#220).",
        "",
        "Upstream's grid was scrollable always, and worse, scrollable by ~18px even",
        "with every tile on screen -- the C++ seeded the layers' content_height",
        "from the 406dp `content` container instead of this 388dp scroll viewport.",
        "Scrolling that grid is what scrambles the tiles; the root cause of the",
        "scramble is still unidentified, so this removes the scroll rather than",
        "claiming a diagnosis. With 3 columns (constants/portrait.json) 9 tiles fit",
        "and the panel shows 7, so on this device the launcher does not scroll at",
        "all. A 10th app puts the scroll -- and the unexplained scramble -- back.",
        "",
        "The false default matters: if the binding ever fails to apply, the",
        "launcher is non-scrolling rather than silently back to the broken shape."
    ],
    "type": "viewScreen",
    "id": "launcher",
    "commonProps": {
        "scrollable": false
    },
    "style": {
        "padding": 0
    },
    "styleRefs": [
        "shell.desktop"
    ],
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "container",
            "id": "content",
            "commonProps": {
                "scrollable": false
            },
            "style": {
                "padding": 0
            },
            "styleRefs": [
                "shell.desktop"
            ],
            "placement": {
                "mode": "absolute",
                "x": 0,
                "y": "${constant.ui.content.metric.y}",
                "width": "${env.widthDp}",
                "height": "${expr(${env.heightDp} - ${constant.ui.content.metric.y})}"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "container",
                    "id": "grid_stage",
                    "commonProps": {
                        "scrollable": false
                    },
                    "style": {
                        "padding": 0
                    },
                    "bindings": {
                        "placement.x": "grid_x",
                        "placement.width": "grid_width",
                        "commonProps.scrollable": "grid_scrollable"
                    },
                    "placement": {
                        "mode": "absolute",
                        "x": "${expr((${env.widthDp} - ${constant.ui.content.metric.launcherGridWidth}) / 2)}",
                        "y": "${constant.ui.content.metric.launcherGridTop}",
                        "width": "${constant.ui.content.metric.launcherGridWidth}",
                        "height": "${expr(${env.heightDp} - ${constant.ui.content.metric.y} - ${constant.ui.content.metric.launcherGridTop})}"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "container",
                            "id": "slot_grid",
                            "commonProps": {
                                "clickable": false,
                                "scrollable": false
                            },
                            "bindings": {
                                "placement.height": "content_height"
                            },
                            "style": {
                                "padding": 0
                            },
                            "layout": {
                                "type": "flex",
                                "flexFlow": "rowWrap",
                                "gap": "${constant.ui.content.metric.launcherItemGap}",
                                "mainAlign": "start",
                                "crossAlign": "start"
                            },
                            "placement": {
                                "mode": "absolute",
                                "x": 0,
                                "y": 0,
                                "width": "match",
                                "height": "match"
                            },
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "container",
                            "id": "item_layer",
                            "commonProps": {
                                "clickable": false,
                                "scrollable": false
                            },
                            "bindings": {
                                "placement.height": "content_height"
                            },
                            "style": {
                                "padding": 0
                            },
                            "placement": {
                                "mode": "absolute",
                                "x": 0,
                                "y": 0,
                                "width": "match",
                                "height": "match"
                            },
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "container",
                            "id": "drag_layer",
                            "commonProps": {
                                "hidden": true,
                                "clickable": false,
                                "scrollable": false
                            },
                            "bindings": {
                                "placement.height": "content_height"
                            },
                            "style": {
                                "padding": 0
                            },
                            "placement": {
                                "mode": "absolute",
                                "x": 0,
                                "y": 0,
                                "width": "match",
                                "height": "match"
                            },
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
